msgid "Pick your poison and we'll make all your dreams come true.\\r\nBut whatever your kink, it's going to cost you."
msgstr "Escoge tu pecado y haremos realidad todos tus deseos.\\r\nPero, sea cual sea tu perversión, te va a costar."

